diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 7f1b4854..c950964c 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -24,6 +24,10 @@ Unreleased
 - A command's short help no longer stops at an abbreviation such as `vs.` or `e.g.`
   inside the first sentence. A period ends the sentence only when it closes the text
   or the next word does not start in lowercase. {pr}`3865`
+- An option's error message with `show_envvar=True` now prints every variable of an
+  `envvar` sequence, rather than the sequence's `repr`. {pr}`3884`
+- An empty `envvar`, such as `[]` or `""`, now shows the same help and error message as
+  no `envvar`. The help screen used to show `[env var: ]`. {pr}`3884`
 
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
